fahrplan2 (2.0.52-leste1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Maemo Leste release: Fahrplan 2 with all backends of the MeeGo
    Harmattan port (2.0.51-meego1), built against Qt 5 for arm64.
  * New QWidget user interface in the style of the Maemo 5 Fahrplan, using
    the QtMaemo5 widgets of Leste: stacked windows, picker buttons for
    stations, date, time, mode and train types, Hildon application menu
    and information banners.
  * Journey search with via station, earlier / later connections and the
    details of a connection; departure and arrival boards; favourite
    stations; stations nearby through liblocation (location-daemon).
  * Translations of the Harmattan pages are reused.

 -- smatkovi <smatkovi@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:30:00 +0200
